icianensis\">PICI\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">AN\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Petri\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">[.]ETRI\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">BA\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">C\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">L\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan data-text=\"Massa\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Massa\">MASSA\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Picianensis\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"Picianensis\">PICIANENSIS\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"Petri\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Petrus\">PETRI\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"baculum\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"baculum\">BACULUM\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000082_tiled.tif\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic000082_tiled-thumb.tif\">\u003C/a>\u003Ca href=\"ISic000082.jpg\">\u003Cimg title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2024-12-03\" src=\"ISic000082-thumb.jpg\">\u003C/a>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text of Bivona 1995\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>Giustolisi speculates that the C in line 2 might be a lunate sigma and so 'basilica' instead, but this seems rather hard to sustain without stronger grounds for the suggestion. The suggestion of Bivona is that this marks the boundary of a property of a church of St Peter.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 1996.0811 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bivona 1995 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Bivona 1997-1998 614 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Giustolisi 1999 17 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  \u003C/div>",[230,233,236,239,242,245,248,251],{"id":231,"html":232},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data