end=\"supraline\">l\u003C/hi>\u003C/abbr>\u003Cex>um\u003C/ex>\u003C/expan>\u003C/w>\n                \u003C/ab>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" subtype=\"simple-lemmatized\" resp=\"#RC\">\n                \u003Cab>\n                    \u003Cw n=\"5\" lemma=\"Massa\">Massa\u003C/w>\n                    \u003Cw n=\"10\" lemma=\"Picianensis\">Picianensis\u003C/w>\n                    \u003Cw n=\"15\" lemma=\"Petrus\">Petri\u003C/w>\n                    \u003Cw n=\"20\" lemma=\"baculum\">baculum\u003C/w>\n                \u003C/ab>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\n                    \u003Capp>\n                        \u003Cnote>Text of Bivona 1995\u003C/note>\n                    \u003C/app>\n                \u003C/listApp>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\">\n                \u003Cp>\u003C!--translation(s) - add @xml:lang for 'en' or 'it' to div-->\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"commentary\">\n                \u003Cp>Giustolisi speculates that the C in line 2 might be a lunate sigma and so 'basilica' instead, but this seems rather hard to sustain without stronger grounds for the suggestion. The suggestion of Bivona is that this marks the boundary of a property of a church of St Peter.\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"bibliography\">\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"edition\">\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"AE\">\n                        \u003CcitedRange>1996.0811\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/R46KDTZX\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001283\u003C/ref>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Bivona\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1997-1998\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>614\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/CK5K5DDG\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002144\u003C/ref>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Bivona\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1995\u003C/date>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/RSMZKCDQ\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002136\u003C/ref>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Giustolisi\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1999\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>17\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/GGJ4H43M\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001944\u003C/ref>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"discussion\">\n                    \u003Cbibl/>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n            \u003C/div>\n        \u003C/body>\n    \u003C/text>\n\u003C/TEI>\n"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
